The corrected row is Nadeau & Bengio: it inflates the variance to admit
that each fold's model trains on the other 4, so the observations are not
independent. Its p-value is always the larger of the two, and it is the one to
quote - a difference that only clears 0.05 uncorrected has not cleared it.

lightgbm_quantiles_flank is +0.0169 better than signal-only, winning 5/5 folds, corrected p = 0.0027. Consistent in direction and significant even after correcting for the overlap between training sets.

